{
  "header": ["The page's extended plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, at most 5 minutes with every timeout counted,",
             "for when a longer play than the regular one (tools/play_plan.json) is needed: the launcher, Add ROM on a new profile",
             "once the shader list Chrome builds behind the launcher is done (Firefox builds none there, and its line saying so is",
             "the one waited for), Start Game once the launcher names the ROM's version (before that the option is Load ROM, and a",
             "click opens the picker again), and the logos; then four places in one load, each started from the game's checkpoint",
             "table as the bar's Chapters menu does (tools/shader_survey.js's startAt, a need that fails the run unless the scene it",
             "asked for is the one playing), its cutscene skipped with L. Windy's first checkpoint: Conker walking back along the",
             "path, away from the stream, and then about 20 s about there: to and fro by as much each way, jumping, swinging and",
             "turning the camera. Then Bats Tower's first checkpoint (69), Sloprano's (116) and Uga Buga's (87), each about 15 s of",
             "Conker out and back by as much about where it starts him, jumping, swinging and turning the camera. Its waits and",
             "holds there are on the game's own clock, the 60ths it adds each frame's length to (0x800BE9AC), so every browser walks",
             "Conker as far whatever frames it gives the game; the last step reads where Conker is (the object whose id is 1, as",
             "func_15083E90(1) finds it)."],
